---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="LAC Memory Kit — Download" description="Thank you. Download your LAC Memory Kit.">

<section style="padding-top: 200px; min-height: 80vh;">
  <div class="container narrow" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 8vw; text-align: center;">

    <div class="eyebrow">You're in</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.1;">Thank you.</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--slate); margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.7;">
      Download your kit below. Unzip it, run <code style="color: var(--gold);">pip install -e .</code>, and hand <code style="color: var(--gold);">INSTALL_ME.md</code> to your model. That's it.
    </p>

    <a href="/lac-memory-kit-v1.0.zip" class="st-btn" style="display: inline-block; font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 16px 48px;">
      Download LAC Memory Kit →
    </a>

    <div style="margin-top: 56px; text-align: left; max-width: 480px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      <div class="eyebrow">Quick start</div>
      <pre class="lac-tree" style="margin-top: 12px;">cd LAC_MEMORY_KIT
pip install -e .

# In your code:
from lac import Memory, Promotion, Voice, Keeper

mem = Memory(root="./memory")
mem.remember("user_name", "Alex", source="onboarding")
hits = mem.recall("who am I talking to?")</pre>

      <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
        The file <code style="color: var(--gold);">INSTALL_ME.md</code> inside the zip is written <em>to the model</em> — not to you. Drop it into your project and tell your AI to read it. It'll wire itself in.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
      Questions? Built something cool? <a href="mailto:reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com" style="color: var(--gold);">reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lac-tree {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    overflow-x: auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

</Layout>
